exp_eggs:"Each star makes her eggs a coin dearer.",exp_chicks:"The more stars, the better his chicks.",exp_ducklings:"The more stars, the better his ducklings.",trust_next:"{n} more cuddles to \u201C{level}\u201D",trust_next1:"1 more cuddle to \u201C{level}\u201D",trust_greets:"Comes to the fence to greet {farmer}.",cuddle_btn:"\u2665 Cuddle",happy_left:"Happy after a cuddle: {when} left",cuddle_night:"Cuddles in the morning: {farmer} is asleep.",cuddle_done:"{farmer} gives {name} a cuddle \u2665 +{xp} XP",trust_up1:"{name} is getting friendly with {farmer}.",trust_up2:"{name} trusts {farmer} now, and comes to the fence to say hello.",trust_up3:"{name} and {farmer} are best friends! +{xp} XP",star_up:"\u2605 {name} has earned a new star!",lives_in:"Lives in: {coop}",since:"On your farm since {date}",coop_rustic:"{coop} (rustic)",level_title:"Level {n}",level_xp:"{xp} of {need} XP to level {next}",level_top:"Top level!",level_how:"Look after your birds to earn XP.",level_up:"Level {n}!",level_up_sub:"Your farm is growing.",level_new:"New at this level",land_new:"A new field is for sale: {c} coins",land_show:"See the field",level_next_land:"At level {n}: a new field for sale",land_count:"Your land: {n} fields",land_count1:"Your land: 1 field",land_all:"All the land is yours!",land_title:"A field",land_body:"Wild meadow with room for a coop or two. Buy it and it\u2019s yours for good: the grass is cut and your fence moves out round it.",land_buy:"Buy for {c} coins",land_broke:"Not enough coins yet ({c})",land_bought:"The new field is yours!",land_wild:"Wild meadow \xB7 for sale at level {n}",sale_sign:"FOR SALE",bub_sale:"For sale",coop_lives:"{names} live here.",and:"and",rustic:"rustic",look_rustic:"Rustic",look_mended:"Mended",look_snug:"Snug",look_cosy:"Cosy",look_deluxe:"Deluxe",up_next:"Upgrade to {look}",up_btn:"Upgrade \xB7 {c} coins",up_broke:"Not enough coins ({c})",up_top:"The finest coop on the farm.",up_rir_mended:"A little shed, half painted red, in a bigger pen.",up_rir_snug:"The Red Barn, in a roomier pen.",up_rir_cosy:"A porch with a bench, lanterns, flowers, and a bigger garden with a swing, a sand bath and a cabbage to peck.",up_rir_deluxe:"A second floor, a copper roof with a cupola, a fountain, a xylophone, a sandbox and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",up_orp_mended:"A little woven hazel hut, half daubed with clay, under new thatch, in a bigger pen.",up_orp_snug:"The Thatched Cottage, in a roomier pen.",up_orp_cosy:"Hollyhocks, roses, a bench under a rose arch, a lantern, and a bigger garden with a swing, a tin bath of sand and a cabbage to peck.",up_orp_deluxe:"A taller cottage in Suffolk pink with windows in its thatch and a straw pheasant on the roof, a pump and trough, a sand pit under a thatched parasol, a xylophone and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",up_sil_mended:"A little bamboo hut with a roof of split bamboo, half painted in its colour, in a bigger pen.",up_sil_snug:"The Pagoda Coop, in a roomier pen.",up_sil_cosy:"A cherry tree in blossom, a stone lantern, paper lanterns, and a bigger garden with a swing under a little red gate, a glazed bowl of sand and a cabbage to peck.",up_sil_deluxe:"Three tiers with little gold bells, a koi pond, a zen garden of raked sand, a bamboo xylophone and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",up_leg_mended:"A little stone hut with its roof slated half way and a new door, in a bigger pen.",up_leg_snug:"The Stone Cottage, in a roomier pen.",up_leg_cosy:"Duck-egg blue windows, wisteria, a dovecote, blue hydrangeas, and a bigger garden with a swing from an apple tree, a wheelbarrow of sand and a cabbage to peck.",up_leg_deluxe:"A storey taller with dormers, a slate porch and two chimneys, a little blue boat full of sand, a water butt, a xylophone and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",up_bra_mended:"A little cabin of new peeled logs under a roof of rough boards, in a bigger pen.",up_bra_snug:"The Timber Lodge, in a roomier pen.",up_bra_cosy:"A woodpile under its own little roof, a wreath on the door, a birdhouse, toadstools and ferns, and a bigger garden with a swing on log posts, a half log full of sand and a cabbage to peck.",up_bra_deluxe:"A storey taller with a gable over the door, a chimney of river stones and a carved bear, a crib of logs full of sand, water from a log flume, a xylophone and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",up_pol_mended:"Its brick rebuilt, a stubby pine tower half painted and a first pair of sails turning, in a bigger pen.",up_pol_snug:"The Little Windmill, in a roomier pen.",up_pol_cosy:"Painted Dutch green under red tiles, striped sails, tulips, clogs by the door, and a bigger garden with a swing, a giant clog full of sand and a cabbage to peck.",up_pol_deluxe:"A taller mill in cream and Delft blue with a copper cap and a gallery, a tiled sandbox, a canal with a drawbridge, a windmill feeder, a xylophone and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",up_aya_mended:"Walls of woven bamboo on a stone base and new clay tiles half laid, in a bigger pen.",up_aya_snug:"The Javanese House, in a roomier pen.",up_aya_cosy:"Green glazed tiles, a frangipani in flower, a banana plant and orchids, and a bigger garden with a swing under a tiled roof, a woven tray of sand and a cabbage to peck.",up_aya_deluxe:"Taller, black and gold, with cream walls, red posts and ceremonial umbrellas, a sand pit of temple stone, a water jar, a little gamelan and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",up_call_mended:"New pine boards half painted duck-egg blue, half a roof of new shingles, its pond cleaned and stones being laid, in a bigger pen.",up_call_snug:"The Floating House on its raft, in a roomier pen.",up_call_cosy:"A little yellow houseboat with a curved teal roof, bunting, flower boxes, a rowing boat, a wider pond and a beach ball to play with.",up_call_deluxe:"White and navy under a red roof, a little lighthouse, Monet\u2019s green bridge to the door, a fountain, water lilies everywhere, a beach ball and the biggest garden, with white pickets and roses.",upfx_mended:"Fewer days without an afternoon egg.",upfx_snug:"Two eggs a day, every day.",upfx_cosy:"Now and then an evening egg too. Chicks a little better. A cuddle counts again after 5 hours.",upfx_deluxe:"An evening egg every other day. Better chicks. A cuddle counts again after 4 hours.",up_room:"Its bigger pen needs more room here: move the coop first.",up_done:"{coop} is now {look}! +{xp} XP",up_busy:"{farmer} is in the pen: try again in a moment.",move_body:"Put it anywhere on your land. Trees, bushes and rocks in the way are cleared.",move_btn:"Move this coop",move_hint:"Drag the coop, or tap where it should go.",move_ok:"A good spot!",move_clear:"A good spot! What\u2019s in the way will be cleared.",move_land:"Only on your own land.",move_lane:"Not on a lane or in the water.",move_room:"Not enough room here.",move_coop:"Too close to another coop.",move_gate:"Its gate would be shut in here.",move_turn:"Turn",move_cancel:"Cancel",move_place:"Put it here",moved:"The coop is in its new place!",move_busy:"Not just now: try again in a moment.",coops_title:"Your coops",coops_aria:"Your coops",coops_waiting:"A new coop is waiting for you",coops_new:"New!",trio_new:"New breed: {breed}!",trio_new_col:"New Silkie colour: {col}!",trio_body:"A rooster and two hens, yours for good, with their own coop. Put it anywhere on your land.",trio_body_duck:"A drake and two ducks, yours for good, with their own house on a pond. Put it anywhere on your land.",place_now:"Place their coop now",later:"Later",later_note:"It waits for you in Your coops (the little barn up top).",place_btn:"Place it",move_short:"Move",coops_next:"At level {n}: {breed}",coops_all:"Every breed is on your farm!",no_room:"No room on your land for another coop yet: buy the next field.",welcome_trio:"Welcome, {names}!",book_title:"Breed Book",book_btn:"\u{1F4D6} Breed Book",book_